@@ -27,10 +27,4 @@ Quick Start
 
 This creates a submission in ``submissions/<surface>/<user>/<case_name>/<datetime>/`` with a zip and PDF plots. Regenerate leaderboards locally with ``stellcoilbench update-db``.
 
-Repository Layout
------------------
-
-- **``cases/``** — YAML case definitions (surface, coils, optimizer). See :doc:`cases`.
-- **``submissions/``** — Results organized as ``submissions/<surface>/<user>/<case_name>/<datetime>/all_files.zip`` (human) or ``submissions/<surface>/auto/<case_id>/results.json`` (autopilot)
-- **``plasma_surfaces/``** — VMEC (``input.*``) and FOCUS (``*.focus``) surface files
-- **``docs/``** — Leaderboards and generated documentation
+Repository layout: **``cases/``** holds YAML case definitions (surface, coils, optimizer; see :doc:`cases`); **``cases/pending/``** and **``cases/done/``** are the autopilot queue and results. **``submissions/``** stores outputs as ``submissions/<surface>/<user>/<case_name>/<datetime>/all_files.zip`` (human) or ``submissions/<surface>/auto/<case_id>/results.json`` (autopilot). **``plasma_surfaces/``** contains VMEC (``input.*``) and FOCUS (``*.focus``) surface files. **``docs/leaderboard/``** and **``docs/leaderboards/``** hold RST and Markdown leaderboards (CI-generated). **``policy/proposer_policy.yaml``** tunes the autopilot; **``tools/``** provides ``propose_batch.py`` and ``build_context.py``. The package lives in **``src/stellcoilbench/``** (``cli.py``, ``coil_optimization/``, ``post_processing.py``, ``update_db/``, ``evaluate.py``, ``reactor_scale.py``, etc.).
